## Version: 12.1.0
## Notes: WoWVoxPacks Text-To-Speech sound keys, selectable via LibSharedMedia in Northern Sky Raid Tools, WeakAuras and BigWigs. Entries are now orange, named 'WVP {Voice}: {Name}', and sit at the bottom of sound dropdowns, so sounds picked from an earlier release have to be re-selected once.
